D	std_internal.dawn	115	123	`std/hamt` is internal to the standard library	it is how `Map` and `Set` are represented, not a container of its own: use std/map or std/set
D	std_internal.dawn	128	136	`std/pvec` is internal to the standard library	it is how `List` is represented, not a container of its own: use std/list, or the builtin list operations
